--- README ---
# tiny-tui

A minimal TUI toolkit for let-go.

## Development

Install dependencies with [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/getting-started.html) (or manaully consulting the `.mise.toml` file):

```bash
mise trust && mise install
```

Run main application commands:
```bash
lgx --help
lgx run
lgx test
lgx fmt
lgx build
```
--- core ---
(ns tiny-tui.core)

(defn greet
  [name]
  (str "Welcome to " name "!"))
--- tests ---
(ns tiny-tui.greeter-test
  (:require [clojure.test :refer :all]
            [tiny-tui.core :as c]))

(deftest test-greet-ok
  (is (= "Welcome to let-go!" (c/greet "let-go"))))

