     4	;; This is one of the two namespaces allowed to touch the terminal (the
     5	;; other is tiny-tui.key). Everything else in tiny-tui is pure.
     6	;;
     7	;; Escape codes are built with (char 27) rather than written as literal
     8	;; control characters, so the source stays readable and editing tools can't
     9	;; corrupt it.
